#X text 40 100 ligase~ is a granular synthesizer/sampler/looper/delay with real-time recording \, reel/splice management \, filtering \, distortion and chaotic parameter modulation inspired by elements of the Morphagene \, Audiomulch's DLGranulator. and Tidalcycles.;
#X text 40 201 See ligase_manual.pdf;
